      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The ashen custodian's innate spellcasting ability is Charisma (spell save DC 15). The ashen custodian can innately cast the following spells, requiring no material components:",
        "At will: druidcraft, produce flame",
        "3/day each: burning hands, cure wounds, flame blade, fog cloud",
        "1/day each: conjure elemental (fire elemental only), wall of fire"
